  "description": "In spite of his youth, the painter Kim Hong-Do has been recognized as the greatest painter in Joseon (Korea). In the midst of wallowing in the pleasures of wine and women, he received an important mission from the king. Why did he end up in Japan? What is the secret of a landscape painting in Osaka Castle? Can this debauched painter succeed in his task?",
